<title>UK: BBA buys Corovin for 40 million stg.</title>
<headline>BBA buys Corovin for 40 million stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BBA Group Plc said it had bought the Corovin Group from Stoehr &amp; Co AG and Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale (WestLB) for 92 million marks, or 40 million stg.</p>
<p>It said that under the deal it would assume debt on a consolidated basis of no more than 86 million marks, of which 33 million marks would be in respect of capital expenditure for a production line expected onstream in 1996.</p>
</text>
